/target
/dist

# What `just wire` / `pinst harness install` wrote on this machine. This
# repo's own .claude/ links are committed directly (they predate the
# installer and stay that way — see .agents/README.md), so the receipt is
# purely local bookkeeping: every contributor running `just wire` gets their
# own timestamp and absolute paths, which is noise in a diff, not a change.
/.ash/harness.json

# Scratch files the unattended /distil run writes at the repo root. None is
# ever committed — the commit step names its paths explicitly — but the
# dry-run patch is built with `git add -N .`, which picked pr-body.md up and
# showed a reviewer a change the real run would never make.
/.distil-report.md
/pr-body.md
/distil.patch
/preflight.out
